{"id":"788217ec669e3bb6","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-posner-unification.md","title":"Posner 的两 oracle 指标合并","display":"lem-posner-unification — Posner 的两 oracle 指标合并","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-posner-unification","aliases":["20-lem-posner-unification"],"display":"lem-posner-unification — Posner 的两 oracle 指标合并","chapter":"6","section":"6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Remark 6.2.2","source_printed_pages":[134,135],"source_pdf_pages":[168,169],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-thm-relative-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-posner-unification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-posner-unification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-posner-unification — Posner 的两 oracle 指标合并"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Remark 6.2.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span><span>135</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>168</span><span>169</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne B\">\\(A\\ne B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6134451906e575\" href=\"?note=8b6134451906e575\" title=\"20-thm-relative-smn\">20-thm-relative-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner\\text{-}unification}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^A\\simeq\\Phi_i^A\\land\\Phi_e^B\\simeq\\Phi_j^B].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner\\text{-}unification}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^A\\simeq\\Phi_i^A\\land\\Phi_e^B\\simeq\\Phi_j^B].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(n)\\ne\\chi_B(n)\">\\(\\chi_A(n)\\ne\\chi_B(n)\\)</span>。把有限参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i,j,n,\\chi_A(n))\">\\((i,j,n,\\chi_A(n))\\)</span> 编入程序：输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，查询当前 oracle 的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 位，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_A(n)\">\\(\\chi_A(n)\\)</span> 则模拟第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个程序，否则模拟第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个。有限参数定理给出一个指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，包括发散情况在内均满足两式。这是存在性论证，不声称能从任意两个集合的名称无 oracle 地找到区别位。</p>\n<p>来源：Remark 6.2.2；印刷页 134, 135；PDF 第 168, 169 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8b6134451906e575","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-relative-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne B","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}posner\\text{-}unification}\\vdash\n\\exists e\\in\\omega\\ [\\Phi_e^A\\simeq\\Phi_i^A\\land\\Phi_e^B\\simeq\\Phi_j^B].","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(n)\\ne\\chi_B(n)","display":false},{"tex":"(i,j,n,\\chi_A(n))","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_A(n)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":1387,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["140cce30ee9c16d1","8b6134451906e575"]}